{"v":4,"catch":"踢人，發射，然後被追！緊急行動！ ！ ！","desc":"「SCRAMBLED EGG」是由Technos Japan於 1983 年推出的動作遊戲。\n踢蛋使其破裂，孵出小雞。然後將所有新的小雞送上天空！\n紅色的小雞和小雞會幫您打倒敵人。請務必好好照顧它們！\n\n「Arcade Archives 2」系列包含「ORIGINAL MODE,」、「HIGH SCORE MODE」、「CARAVAN MODE」和「TIME ATTACK MODE」。\n它還擁有多個存檔槽、可重新開始遊戲的倒帶功能，以及方便想要立即上手的快速啟動功能。\n此外，也新增了 VRR 支持，能夠更精準地再現原版街機遊戲的體驗。\n在更有趣、更易用的「Arcade Archives 2」中，享受那些定義時代的經典街機遊戲。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-08-28","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/421d961e2b8fa3fd16c48c9401288f808df87f84d451eb6073ef3096b64a82db.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e61ea52e301ba46beab444a810a8aa1d4e7a22dfb7117189a00f646ba7c7e515.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d83c0077d98a96907d3cc9e5c64711e40ed5d0152bcf61dfe6c8e4d160b1a8e7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4dea481c8ff56faece66ffe9de2818d1983136a41e83a535847e4d4786fb3e68.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/96b8e3db70d8d4aea27d242f84a97fed399b9519e58d95a75347bce079c8a8bc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e656185b07d29493de82e7e1a6237a9f6010ad3a39e33df31042e049d4754095.jpg"],"titleId":"0400a69024378000","dlc":[]}